# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# bendclear.sm -- A short hole in the corner of the box of a bend
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# A hole along z, beside the outer face of the bend of a flange, lies
# inside the box of the bend but clear of its material.  It cuts no
# slab, so smfold warns that it misses the part.
sheet 1 1 0.44
plate base 0 0 40 20 origin 0 0 0 axes +x +y
flange w base +x 90 20
hole 0.4 41.7 10 along z at -0.8 depth 0.8
